  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BOL Vicemin Ciencia y Tecnologia 2013-2022 - Vicemin Science and Technology (Min of Educ)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BOL Vicemin f&#xf6;r vetenskap och tekn 2013-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to scientific journals, increased capacity in writing skills and the use of scientific information, dissemination of bolivian      publications. Part of the entire research support to Bolivia, incl    UMSA and UMSS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tillg&#xe5;ng till vetenskapliga tidskrifter, &#xf6;kad kapacitet inom skrivande och nyttjande av vetenskaplig information, spridning av     bolivianska publikationer</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">General objective:
Improve access, use, production and dissemination of scientific and technological information in Bolivian academic and research institutions.
Specific objectives:
- Increase the use of national and international scientific information resources.
- Increase production and visibility of local and national scientific publications.
- Increase the number of collaborative activities in information management within academic and scientific community.</narrative>
  </description>
